# 仓库内统一使用 LF，减少 Windows 上「LF will be replaced by CRLF」类提示；
# 检出行为仍受全局 core.autocrlf 影响，团队可配合设置 core.autocrlf=false（仅本仓库见下方说明）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制（禁止换行符转换）
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
